{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2021年，发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字分析，壬水日主生于申月，月柱庚申，时柱壬子，金水两旺，身极强。大运乙卯（45-54岁），伤官泄秀，本为破局求财之运。2021年流年辛丑，天干辛金正印透出，与月干庚金偏印混杂，且辛金坐丑土为入墓。地支丑土与年柱丑土伏吟，父母宫动，同时丑为辛金之库，正印入墓，此为母亲灾病之兆。丑与命局年支丑、日支辰形成丑辰破，亦主家人分离。天干辛金直克大运乙木伤官，形成“枭神夺食”，食伤为财源，受克则事业受阻，财路狭窄。然伏吟并印星入墓之象重于财困，且辛丑年疫情防控背景，辛为肺金，丑为湿土病毒，印星坐墓直指母亲染疫过世。综合分析，当年最核心事件为母亲病逝。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R0_P1_G3\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R0_P1_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 87088, "response_id": "aa21edb7-a950-4d11-81a3-3a7eaeeb3821", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 241, "completion_tokens": 4563, "total_tokens": 4804, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 4318}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 113}}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", "domain": "health", "question": "命主在2024年的健康状况如何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字分析：日主壬水生于申月，地支申子辰三合水局，时柱壬子，水势极旺，为身强水泛之格。命局喜用土制水、木泄秀，但原局土弱木缺，金水寒凝。2024年命主51岁，正行乙丑大运（45-54岁），流年甲辰。\n\n大运乙丑，天干乙木伤官透出，地支丑土正官制水，本是喜用。流年甲辰，天干甲木食神泄身，地支辰土七杀，表面上看木土齐来为吉，但深入分析：\n- 原局月干庚金强旺，大运乙木被庚金合克，流年甲木坐辰虚浮无根，亦被庚金冲克，木气大伤。木主筋骨、脊柱、肝胆。\n- 大运支丑为艮卦，象背部、脊椎，乙木坐丑，有脊椎柔弱之象。乙庚合，金克木，筋脉拘挛。\n- 流年甲辰，与日柱壬辰伏吟，辰辰自刑，土气愈湿，制水乏力。且甲木为直木，受克则易弯曲变形，正应脊柱侧弯。\n- 命局无冲战，流年亦无金舆、驿马逢冲之象，不主突发车祸。金水旺而火衰，无燥热毒结之机，亦不主癌变。水多土流，湿气重，易致肥胖，但此非2024年突发的核心问题。\n\n综合判断，2024年最突出的健康隐患是金木交战导致筋骨损伤，且大运丑土、乙木均指向脊椎，系长期久坐加重而成。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R0_P1_G3\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R0_P1_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 55829, "response_id": "87f290e2-9bd8-40eb-b253-ef832c5e7d1b", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 238, "completion_tokens": 2849, "total_tokens": 3087, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2445}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 110}}
